-- Service role policy (bypasses RLS)
-- ============================================================

-- R6: Server-side code using the service role keeps full access
-- This is implicitly handled by Supabase - service_role bypasses RLS
-- No additional policy needed as service_role bypasses RLS by default

-- ============================================================
-- Grant for authenticated users (default access)
-- ============================================================

